notability chat — Notability AI chat threads about your notes

Usage: notability chat <command>

Commands:
  ask       Ask Notability AI (optionally about a note)
  backfill  Index recently edited notes for AI chat
  context   What the assistant's note_read tool receives for a note (typed, PDF and transcript text)
  delete    Delete a thread
  read      Read a thread
  threads   List chat threads

Global Options:
  --filter-output <keys>              Filter output by key paths (e.g. foo,bar.baz,a[0,3])
  --format <toon|json|yaml|md|jsonl>  Output format
  --full-output                       Show full output envelope
  --help                              Show help
  --llms, --llms-full                 Print LLM-readable manifest
  --schema                            Show JSON Schema for command
  --token-count                       Print token count of output (instead of output)
  --token-limit <n>                   Limit output to n tokens
  --token-offset <n>                  Skip first n tokens of output
